1
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:11,490
There was an idea to bring together a group of remarkable people

2
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:15,420
to see if we could become

3
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:21,560
something more than us.

4
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:28,280
We could fight the battles that they never could.

5
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:55,680
Like to feel so desperately that you're right, yet to fail all

6
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:56,280
the same.

7
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:08,480
Dread it, run from it, destiny still arrives.

8
00:01:17,470 --> 00:01:25,070
Evacuate the city, get your defenses, and get this man a shield.

9
00:01:38,290 --> 00:01:41,290
Isn't something one considers for balancing the universe?
